        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tale of Redemption in the Wild Frontier</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blood and Dust</i> follows the story of <strong>Henry Bridger</strong>, a former outlaw who narrowly escapes death after being betrayed by his own gang. Rescued by <strong>Clara</strong>, the daughter of the town doctor, Henry wakes up in the small frontier settlement of <strong>Goldfield</strong>, wounded, confused, and with no memory of his past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As he slowly rebuilds his life, Henry must face the shadows of who he once was — choosing between the path of redemption or falling once again into the violence of the West. Along the way, his bond with Clara grows into a heartfelt romance, and his story transforms into one of forgiveness, purpose, and self-discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a handcrafted open-world western adventure that blends story, exploration, and immersive simulation elements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌄 <strong>Fully explorable open world</strong> — travel through forests, mines, lakes, and dusty frontier towns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌞 <strong>Dynamic day and night cycle</strong> — watch Goldfield come alive as NPCs follow daily routines and the world evolves around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💼 <strong>Working and trading system</strong> — earn money through mining, hunting, and local jobs, then trade your goods in the town stores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Combat and weapon mechanics</strong> — engage in gunfights with enemies or hunt wild animals across the frontier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐎 <strong>Mounts and travel</strong> — tame and ride horses to explore distant regions of the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏕️ <strong>Immersive survival elements</strong> — collect items, manage resources, and craft your own path through the wilderness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌧️ <strong>Environmental realism</strong> — powered by Unity HDRP, featuring advanced lighting, reflections, and ambient sound design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧍 <strong>Interactive NPCs</strong> — every character has a schedule, personality, and unique dialogue options that react to your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 <strong>Swimming and ambient life</strong> — dive into lakes, hear the birds and wind, and feel the rhythm of nature.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Notice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains <strong>mild violence</strong> (such as gunfights, hunting scenes, and injury depictions), <strong>partial non-explicit nudity</strong>, and <strong>strong language</strong>, as well as <strong>depictions of alcohol and tobacco use</strong> in line with its mature Western setting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer’s Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blood and Dust</i> is an <strong>indie project developed by a single creator</strong>, built using the <strong>latest version of Unity (HDRP)</strong> to deliver a cinematic and immersive experience.<br>Despite its independent nature, the game uses <strong>high-quality, AAA-grade assets</strong> and technologies to achieve a rich visual presentation and detailed open-world atmosphere.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tale of Redemption in the Wild Frontier</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blood and Dust</i> follows the story of <strong>Henry Bridger</strong>, a former outlaw who narrowly escapes death after being betrayed by his own gang. Rescued by <strong>Clara</strong>, the daughter of the town doctor, Henry wakes up in the small frontier settlement of <strong>Goldfield</strong>, wounded, confused, and with no memory of his past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As he slowly rebuilds his life, Henry must face the shadows of who he once was — choosing between the path of redemption or falling once again into the violence of the West. Along the way, his bond with Clara grows into a heartfelt romance, and his story transforms into one of forgiveness, purpose, and self-discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a handcrafted open-world western adventure that blends story, exploration, and immersive simulation elements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌄 <strong>Fully explorable open world</strong> — travel through forests, mines, lakes, and dusty frontier towns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌞 <strong>Dynamic day and night cycle</strong> — watch Goldfield come alive as NPCs follow daily routines and the world evolves around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💼 <strong>Working and trading system</strong> — earn money through mining, hunting, and local jobs, then trade your goods in the town stores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Combat and weapon mechanics</strong> — engage in gunfights with enemies or hunt wild animals across the frontier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐎 <strong>Mounts and travel</strong> — tame and ride horses to explore distant regions of the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏕️ <strong>Immersive survival elements</strong> — collect items, manage resources, and craft your own path through the wilderness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌧️ <strong>Environmental realism</strong> — powered by Unity HDRP, featuring advanced lighting, reflections, and ambient sound design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧍 <strong>Interactive NPCs</strong> — every character has a schedule, personality, and unique dialogue options that react to your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 <strong>Swimming and ambient life</strong> — dive into lakes, hear the birds and wind, and feel the rhythm of nature.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Notice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains <strong>mild violence</strong> (such as gunfights, hunting scenes, and injury depictions), <strong>partial non-explicit nudity</strong>, and <strong>strong language</strong>, as well as <strong>depictions of alcohol and tobacco use</strong> in line with its mature Western setting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer’s Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blood and Dust</i> is an <strong>indie project developed by a single creator</strong>, built using the <strong>latest version of Unity (HDRP)</strong> to deliver a cinematic and immersive experience.<br>Despite its independent nature, the game uses <strong>high-quality, AAA-grade assets</strong> and technologies to achieve a rich visual presentation and detailed open-world atmosphere.</p>",
